1
00:00:00,392 --> 00:00:01,722
(Leonard:)Where are you gonna live?

2
00:00:01,894 --> 00:00:05,064
(Sheldon:)Until I find a permanent place,
I will stay with friends.

3
00:00:05,231 --> 00:00:06,311
(Howard:)Bye.

4
00:00:09,568 --> 00:00:13,158
Well... But you can't stay with me.
I have a teeny-tiny apartment.

5
00:00:13,322 --> 00:00:17,622
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, but isn't hosting guests
an aspect of manushya yajna...

6
00:00:17,785 --> 00:00:22,625
(Sheldon:)...one of the five central religious duties
or sacrifices of the Hindu householder?

7
00:00:25,835 --> 00:00:28,465
(Raj:)I hate trains.

8
00:00:33,634 --> 00:00:36,134
(Sheldon:)Don't be ridiculous. You love trains.

9
00:00:37,429 --> 00:00:38,889
(Raj:)Yes, I do. Come on.

10
00:00:41,642 --> 00:00:43,682
(Raj:)See you later, Leonard.

11
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,820
(Leonard:)This could work.

12
00:00:57,199 --> 00:01:01,019
[INDIAN MUSIC PLAYING
ON TELEVISION]

